THIRD-PARTY MODEL ATTRIBUTION
=============================

Whispy transcribes speech using a machine-learning model it does not
redistribute. The weights are downloaded from the Hugging Face Hub on first
run and cached on the user's machine; no model files are contained in this
repository or in any Whispy release artifact.

