ONNX conversion
---------------
Whispy loads the int8-quantized ONNX conversion of the model published at

    https://huggingface.co/istupakov/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3-onnx

through the onnx-asr package (MIT), https://github.com/istupakov/onnx-asr.

The CC-BY-4.0 licence on the model weights and the GPLv3 licence on this
program apply to separate works: Whispy is a program that fetches and runs the
model, not a derivative of it, and the two are never distributed together.
